Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination over the larger pool3 to see if a more inclusive set improves over the current best_single rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

